# Conformance probe pack for groups (spec 0.7) on the `json` wire. Public. No
# kinds. A list of object items with a nested object, a `const`, a `default`
# and a nested list; three lists of scalar items (`.`), one of them inside a
# nested object; and a common `default` for a key that items also hold, which
# does not reach into items.
format  conformance-groups-json
version 0.7.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    json
field   uid          id        string
field   probe.label  title     string
default probe.label  NONE                  # common: written at `title`, never inside an item
group   probe.items  items
  field   probe.label  name     string
  field   probe.qty    n        int
  field   probe.ratio  r.value  float
  const   kind         item
  default probe.qty    1                   # per item
  group   probe.subs   subs
    field  probe.tag  t  string
    field  probe.val  v  int
  end
end
field   callsign     cs        string
group   probe.nums   data.nums
  field  probe.val  .  int
end
group   probe.names  names
  field  probe.tag  .  string
end
group   probe.ratios ratios
  field  probe.ratio  .  float
end
